<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Summit Properties lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Summit Properties lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Monday it lowered its rating on the shares of Summit Properties Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 19-13/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
